{
  "$meta": {
    "name": "ODAP Design Tokens",
    "version": "2.0.0",
    "designer": "颜好看",
    "layerModel": ["primitive", "semantic", "component"],
    "appearances": ["luminous", "nebula"],
    "accents": ["cobalt", "teal", "indigo", "graphite"],
    "runtimeBinding": "html[data-appearance][data-accent] -> CSS custom properties, mirrored into AntD ConfigProvider token",
    "cssFile": "docs/04-ui/design-tokens.css",
    "notes": [
      "primitive 层保存原始值; semantic/component 层一律以 alias 引用, 不允许散落硬编码色值",
      "禁止跨色相渐变 (紫->粉/品红); 渐变仅允许同色相深浅",
      "禁止 emoji 作功能图标; 图标来自 Spec 锁定的统一描边 SVG 图标库, 尺寸 16/20/24px",
      "禁止弹跳/过冲缓动"
    ]
  },

